applies-filter: [<currentTiddler>!role[log]!role[decision]!role[task]!role[tasklist]]
type: text/vnd.tiddlywiki

Several values from the vocabulary in `list`: a tiddler can wait on several kinds of work at once. The stored value is the space-separated list of slugs, so filters must treat it as a list — `[contains:needs[verify]]`, not `[needs[verify]]`, which only matches a field holding that single value.

`applies-filter`: same roles as `maturity`.
